Subject: [PATCH] docs(skills): review-prs label states - green merge-ready,
 red needs-rework, orange conflicts

A conflicting PR is never green: it gets the orange 'conflicts' label until
its branch is refreshed, and each run re-checks green PRs for new conflicts.

